//발행기관영문약명 길이가 해당길이를 초과하면 띄어쓰기 단위로 삭제 후 리턴
/**
 * @method
 * @name fn_cut_spacingWords
 * @description desc
 * @param {string} words desc
 * @param {string} len desc
 * @returns
 * @hidden N
 * @exception
 * @example
 */
scwin.fn_cut_spacingWords = function(words, len) {
    //alert($('#com_eng_abbrv').val().length);
    //alert(len);
    if (words.length > len) {
        //공백있을때
        if (words.indexOf(' ') > -1) {
            var num = 0;
            var split_temp1 = '';
            var split_temp2 = '';
            var split_arr;
            split_arr = words.split(' ');

            //띄어쓰기로 분할후 len길이만큼 글자가 초과하지않는 단어수 계산
            for (var i in split_arr) {
                if (split_temp1.length > len) {
                    num = parseInt(i) - parseInt(1);
                    break;
                } else {
                    if (i == 0) {
                        split_temp1 += split_arr[i];
                    } else {
                        split_temp1 += ' ' + split_arr[i];
                    }
                    num = parseInt(i);
                }

                //alert(i +"::"+ split_temp1);

            }
            //alert(num);

            //단어수만큼만 분리
            for (var i = 0; i < num; i++) {
                if (i == 0) {
                    split_temp2 += split_arr[i];
                } else {
                    split_temp2 += ' ' + split_arr[i];
                }
                //alert(split_temp2);

            }
            words = split_temp2;

            //공백없을때

        } else {
            words = words.substring(0, len);
        }
    }
    return words;
};
